# OpenSpec workflow (MVDS)

Copied/adapted from experiment-hub. Schema SoT for this repo: [`openspec/schemas/experiment-hub-lite/`](../openspec/schemas/experiment-hub-lite/).

## When to use

- **OpenSpec lite** (default, only schema bootstrapped): Human anchor, Outcomes, specs (≤5 requirements), design (Figma table for UI), tasks §1 = user scenarios. `/opsx:propose` creates **one artifact per approval**.
- **Cursor-only plans** are fine for tiny chores; use OpenSpec when you want durable proposal/design/tasks and Figma iteration before code.
- Do **not** invent `bhd-experiment` or full `experiment-hub` schemas until they are copied into this repo.

## Git discipline

Match [github-workflow.mdc](github-workflow.mdc) and AGENTS.md Branch & PR workflow: one feature branch, draft PR, founder merges. Align change folder name with the branch when practical (`feat/storybook-start-here` ↔ `openspec/changes/storybook-start-here/`).

**`/opsx:apply`:** Implement tasks; when apply finishes, commit + push + draft PR per schema `apply.instruction` and [`skills/openspec-apply-change.md`](../skills/openspec-apply-change.md). **`/opsx:propose`** does not commit.

## Figma and `design.md`

UI-impacting changes MUST document design context in `design.md` (see [figma.mdc](figma.mdc)). Map to MVDS tokens/components. Library sync to MVDS Core only when the founder asks.

